The fix requires `asyncio.wait()` with `return_when=asyncio.ALL_COMPLETED` to collect all GraphInterrupt exceptions before raising, matching the pattern used `in _panic_or_proceed()`. Both sync and async paths need fixing, plus proper interrupt ID correlation to originating tool calls.

